MAGNETICS CONSTRUCTION
Text Notes 6110 23420 0    60   ~ 0
identity per docs/magnetics.md (turns, gap, litz, acceptance lines live there)
Text Notes 6100 23850 0    60   ~ 0
D3 T1-T3: 2x E70/33/32 sets (B66372B2000 former), 5:5:5, Bpk 109mT, pri litz 4370x0.071 + sec foil 0.127x28 (E60), web-bonded, Lm 63uH +/-7%
Text Notes 6100 24150 0    60   ~ 0
D2 L1T-L3T: 2x E70/33/32, N=3, bins 2.8/3.0/3.2uH, litz 2500x0.1 (19.6mm2, E60 proximity rev)
Text Notes 6100 24450 0    60   ~ 0
total Lr = trim + measured xfmr leakage (bins COMPENSATE leakage spread); Cr at TANK sections
